Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for me, Kosaku Kawajiri's\Nshoes are a little on the large side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To avert suspicion, I have to gradually\Nswap them out with ones that actually fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No goodbye for your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a good day at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something horrible is lurking downstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, honey, it was utterly horrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was scary, but now I get to melt into\Nthe rugged arms of the man of my dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you so much, honey buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to get that\Nstrange cat out of our basement
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cat?
