Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.83,0:02:36.34,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 30: {\fs80} The Cat Who Grew Fond of Kira Yoshikage
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.92,0:02:34.92,Main,Shinobu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Before we go down there, let me tell you what scared me.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.92,0:02:40.68,Main,Shinobu,0,0,0,,{\an8}I went down to the basement\N since we had run out of mineral water, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out to be one of those adorable british\Nshort hairs could you believe it it had
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perfect proportions had those gorgeous\Nyellow eyes and velvety bluish gray fur
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were to die for well aren't you just the\Ncutest now how did you get in here whoops
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bad idea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he must have come in through
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The window he's a cute little thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he can't stay down here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't get him to scat, he\Nmight pee on that potato sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and what if he has fleas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, all I have to do is avoid eye\Ncontact and approach nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I show him I'm not a threat,\NI'm sure he'll let me get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kitty, I'm showing you my\Nbelly and being submissive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be friends. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I begging for this cat's attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to scram, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've more than outstayed your welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.98,0:03:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't test me, cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.42,0:03:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was hanging on the ceiling\Nlike some kind of furry bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As terrifying as that\Nwas, it gets even scarier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy, but when I saw its\Nneck, it had a gaping hole in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was as big as a one-yen coin, and\Nthen I heard something come out of it.
