Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, a hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curious, could it be a\Nwound from the arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swung the broom at him like a mad\Nwoman before he finally ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, can you go down\Nthere and look around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said he had a gash in his throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, dear, what's going on down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the cat gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is. Dead and gone. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shards of glass that\Nripped through his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one did anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Least of all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently he had a gash in\Nhis throat before the accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now there's no telling\Nif he was a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he was just an ordinary cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mario.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.83,0:05:59.63,Narrator,My Nigga Kai Harada,0,0,0,,{\an8}Good morning, Morioh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing better than the\Nmorning after a heavy rain, am I right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.63,0:06:02.92,Narrator,My Nigga Kai Harada,0,0,0,,{\an8}Quite a lovely morning now that the rain has stopped, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.92,0:06:07.84,Narrator,My Nigga Kai Harada,0,0,0,,{\an8}Right before I got to the studio, I saw a rainbow in the sky! \NDo you think it's still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw a beautiful rainbow\Non my way to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thought to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meow, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone got me with an\Narrow a couple of days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I thought I came\Nout of that scrap okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body is totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it all weird now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why the hell am I stuck in the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He meowed in panicked confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the world did\Nhe bury him? Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, pretty kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, who is this strange\Nlady, he wondered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a real bad feeling about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The broom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:06:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was there when all that glass got stuck\Nin me and I wasn't able to move anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in this whole mess because\Nof that horrible woman, he fumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flurry of confusion overcame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that, he thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I let my anger for that\Nlady out, she fell over in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My toenail!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it might be a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I get it from that cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having survived his entire life\Nby using his animal instincts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he intuitively understood his\Nnew power and how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little bastard's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is this thing growing where\NI buried the stray cat last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for that matter, what the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did it do to that sparrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't catch a glimpse of its stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to somehow figure out whether\Nthis thing poses a genuine threat to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem like it wants me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even so, to be on the safe\Nside, I'll have to prune it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It fell asleep eating its prey. Is it a\Ntype of plant or could it be an animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eliminating it would be easy so i\Nhave time for a little investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the way it innately\Nlooked back at me when i
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,called it appeared almost\Ncat-like how strange
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the way it seems compelled to sniff\Nmy hand is also uniquely feline
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it enjoys being petted as well
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,factoring that in with its\Neerie purring it's acting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like a cat does before it\Nfalls asleep but none of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that tells me whether it\Nharbors any ill will toward
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me i have to know for sure\Nand there's only one way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well it's certainly angry but at the\Nvery least now I know this thing doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to do me any harm there's no doubt\Nit's the cat I buried here yesterday so the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gouge in its throat\Nwas from the arrow what
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does it mean um honey
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's her I wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:10:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand in that spot if I were you. My\Ntoenail got ripped off right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cat must have gotten\Nangry and attacked the woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if she ever found out this thing existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd run her big mouth\Nand gossip would eventually
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spread to Jotaro Kujo and\Nhis obnoxious cohorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't allow that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where you buried the cat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like that spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like it's cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I buried the cat somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now please go back inside\Nand nurse your foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying to protect me\Nfrom something, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, it looks like I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cat is gonna be nothing but trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not know what its stand can do,\Nbut I'll exterminate it nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.16,0:10:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.46,0:10:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you're about to be uprooted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bob Type 1, switch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.34,0:11:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way it could be a dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.74,0:11:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means this thing did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have anti-detonation abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I just tell you to go inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment that cat plant batted away\NKiller Queen's bomb, it exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this thing's ability be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the creature saw the woman lying\Nunconscious, it thought, I'm going to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your attack's on her end now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he wants to get in the\Nway, then he dies too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bomb failed to explode\Nbecause it was deprived of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plant instinctively\Nknew how best to utilize
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its newly acquired abilities\Nto kill its enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could its Stand ability be\Nto control the air around it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.02,0:12:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It fired something, but\NI couldn't see what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it did shoot at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weaponizing masses of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pound you into fertilizer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm pressing\Non an invisible balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really can manipulate the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it must have released another\None of those compressed air bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where did that creature aim it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hit the cactus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ushikaga Kira just feel a\Nsense of relief for this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,woman because the cactus\Nneedles missed her eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I actually be\Nworried about someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only concern is what\Nmight happen if this woman
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dies and Jotaro Cujoh\Ndiscovers I'm at this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only reason I'm\Nrelieved to see that she's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.58,0:13:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your air attack is now powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your projectiles might be invisible,\Nbut I know how your tricks work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You simply compress air and launch it at
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your opponent in a\Nscattering of projectiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Deadly Queen knows how\Nto get around your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little shit he\Ninjected an air bubble into
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my vein it's traveling\Ndeeper into my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly a medical\Nexpert but injecting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more than 10 cc's of any gas into a vein
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can cause blood vessel\Nblockage and death and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive this is way\Nmore than 10 cc's. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I can't get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do it! Deadly Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I underestimated that wretched weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its power to control an attack with air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more formidable than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's preparing to fire again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was far too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll let it slide for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its execution has been stayed.
