Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.00,0:15:39.00,Eyecatch - Episode 30 (small),Sign bot,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1514,489)}Former cat-\Nturned-plant
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.32,0:15:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kosaku told me that he buried that\Npoor kitty far away from the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I told him about the cat's curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he said it was just a figment of\Nmy imagination brought on by fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that I should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fainted right in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he was nice enough to\Nstay home and look after me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though it made him late for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It felt like he understood\Nme for the first time ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has been the most\Nblissful morning of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are you enjoying it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that boy left\Nhome without saying goodbye again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he been watching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're eating from my plate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.82,0:16:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how you hate shiitake mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I took them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What brought about this\Nsudden change of heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you've already eaten\Nmore than half of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.48,0:16:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positively thrilled to\Nsee you wolfing them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not so bad when you\Ngive them a chance, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:16:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you have a good day, sweetie pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goodbye kiss would have been nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I feel as though\Nwe're closer than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And before long, my seductive\Nlove will overwhelm him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He put his shoes on with a shoehorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he was definitely wearing\N25.5 centimeter size shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he have shoes that\Nare two different sizes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even weirder, mom and dad are\Ngetting along better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he scarfed down those mushrooms\Neven though he hates them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:17:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all so bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why in the world would he need to practice\Nwriting his name over and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then there's what I\Nsaw happen last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept replaying the footage,\Nbut that's just a pot of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could he be doing with that\Nmuch soil and a bag of cat food?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he goes into the closet\Nlike everything's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all wearing hats.\NIs that part of their
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dress code what is this i'm\Ngetting a strange feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The attic
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Oh man. That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way too dark in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.59,0:19:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That plant is moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not a plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.14,0:19:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's looking right at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.58,0:19:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:20:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could that bag of cat\Nfood be for this creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you back then, Shantani.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.30,0:20:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you realize you left without\Ngiving me a goodbye kiss? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can get it for you if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.10,0:20:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the heck did he come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did this plant do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these weird things on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm being strangled by some\Nkind of invisible inflatable shackles!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being pinned to the\Nair by the air itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming up the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta get free!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That came from the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that brat was up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.24,0:20:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hauled off and attacked me\Nwhen I tried to shut the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.76,0:20:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean it needs sunlight to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:20:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm being held by masses of air...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.76,0:21:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the sunlight was fueling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the feral cat try to get its food from
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the shelf and end up\Nspilling it on the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the lack of sunlight would\Nkeep it calm for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But traces of light are\Nseeping in through the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I thought Hayato may\Nhave rummaged around up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess I can chalk\Nthat up to overthinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, had that little brat discovered\Nthe truth about who I really am,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I would have had no choice\Nbut to put an end to his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.44,0:22:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somehow he's wearing my\Ndad's face but that's not my
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.50,0:22:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dad who is that guy why is\Nhe here what does he want
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.26,0:22:54.51,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.51,0:22:57.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.31,0:22:58.98,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.98,0:23:01.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.35,0:23:03.73,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.73,0:23:06.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.53,0:23:08.24,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand a little bit closer.
