Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.98,0:23:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.45,0:23:17.08,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.08,0:23:21.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.66,0:23:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I need you,\Nbut oh, I got to find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.58,0:23:25.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I want you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.13,0:23:30.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.94,0:23:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I need you,\Nbut oh, I got to find you.
